        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Pemko 72\"  Door Threshold with Weather Seal</b>\r\n<p>\r\nPemko 5\" wide x 72\" long x 1/2\" high door threshold. These 72 inch long thresholds are made from non rusting extruded aluminum.  Used for double 36\" wide outswing doors. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Allow 3/8\" bottom door clearance.</b> Field sizable, non-handed. Powder coated finish.  Packaged with installation screws.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for Pemko 2005AT-72 Door Threshold\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 72\" (6 ft.)</li>\r\n<li>Height: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Weather Seal: Black Thermo Seal Insert</li>\r\n<li>Material: Aluminum</li>\r\n<li>Finish: Clear Powder Coated</li>\r\n<li><b>ADA Compliant</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis 72\" threshold is ramped on both sides for easy access. For use on outswing double  doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually.</b>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<b>Discontinued, use <a href=\"/products/5-x-1-2-x-72-bumper-threshold-ngp-896v-72\">NGP 896V-72 5 x 1/2 x 72 Bumper Threshold</b></a>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n</p>",
